DESCRIPTION:Edinburgh Comedy Award nominee\, Melbourne International Comedy
  Festival winner and acclaimed social media star Sarah Keyworth is back at 
 Fringe with a new work-in-progress show! Known for their sharp wit\, heartf
 elt storytelling\, and exploration of gender identity\, Sarah has appeared 
 on television comedy shows such as Live At The Apollo\, Mock the Week and 8
  Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown. Keyworth has also written for The Now Show 
 on BBC Radio 4 as well as their own show Are You A Boy Or A Girl?\, a timel
 y\, hilarious and insightful exploration of gender.\nMore info: https://com
 edyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/sarah-keyworth-work-in-progress/
